Z||000000||Seanh||05-21-2001||07:05 PM||||Anyone have any pictures of their (or anyones) interior done in a red/grey color scheme. I am thinking of doing the seats red, trimmed in either light or dark gray, but I'm not sure what to do with the rest of the interior yet. Any Ideas, suggestions, comments? I was thinking about doing the dash maybe dark gray, radio surround in light grey, shifter surround in red(?) and console between the seats in light gray? I don't know, gimme some ideas. Thanks||||reg||1
